From 968c89af32f1eb9f35105f96978b10eb82b539e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:28:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] scratch archive: count a remote-tracking tip only
 while the remote still holds it

Review t_01a1d59fe7211df2 of 418f13ab2f (request changes): plan_repo trusted every
refs/remotes/<network remote>/* oid as held by the remote. A branch deleted (or
force-pushed away) and gc'd there left its objects in neither the supplement pack nor
commits.bundle (--not --remotes); the archive still verified complete, the workspace was
removed, and restore could not recover the commit.

Fix:
- _verified_tips: each recorded tip must be advertised by `git ls-remote <url>` now, or be
  contained by an advertised branch (commits-only `clone --bare --filter=tree:0
  --reference <repo>` plus one `rev-list --branches` walk). Dropped tips' objects go into
  the supplement pack. Any probe failure keeps the repo's objects in the payload (v1).
- The probe runs in a neutral temp dir with the user's git config (credential helpers,
  URL rewrites) and never prompts (GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0, GCM_INTERACTIVE=Never, ssh
  BatchMode, hooks/fsmonitor off). The scratch repo's own config never applies.
- Promisor packs are no longer proof on their own: a partial clone's local blob counts as
  held only when it is in HEAD's nearest pushed trees.
- restore: skips fetching recorded tips the clone already holds. Omitted files in a
  read-only directory are written with temporary owner write, and every touched
  directory gets its archived mode and mtime back (review nit).

Tests (tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_scratch_gc_archive.py), all RED with the old
behaviour and GREEN now:
- tip_the_remote_deleted_and_gcd_is_archived_not_omitted (the review repro, restored)
- unreachable_remote_keeps_every_object
- restore_writes_omitted_files_into_read_only_directories
- remote_probe_ignores_the_scratch_repos_own_config
- tip_behind_a_moved_remote_branch_still_counts_as_held (keeps savings when main moved)
gc_archive + partial_clone + custody suites: 239 passed.

Bench (private daveey/hermes clones on worker-4, probing GitHub for real):
full clone 1.35 GB -> 12.0 MB (0.89 %), 37.7 s; 31 of 1141 tips stale, 392 objects
(2.1 MB) moved to the supplement pack; restore from GitHub 236 s, HEAD and
`diff -rq -x objects` identical. Blobless clone 282 MB -> 9.9 MB (3.5 %).
